tion--order\">\n<div class=\"product-order\">\n<div class=\"product-order__row\">\n<div class=\"product-order__block\">\n<div class=\"counter counter--large j-buy-button-counter\" data-gift=\"0\" data-id=\"552\" data-skin=\"default\" id=\"j-buy-button-counter-552\">\n<div class=\"counter__container\">\n<div class=\"counter-input\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"counter__units\"></div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"product-order__block product-order__block--buy\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__column-item\">\n<div class=\"product__group product__group--tabs\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<nav class=\"product-heading__nav\" id=\"nav-6af745b14488e\">\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#delivery-2\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Delivery</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#payment-2\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Payment</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#guarantee-2\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Guarantee</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"delivery-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>Nova Post  branch delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p>Nova Post  parcel locker delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p>Nova Post courier delivery - carrier's rates apply</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://betrendy.space/oplata-i-dostavka/\">More about delivery</a></p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"payment-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>Payment to the current account:</p>\n<p>Beneficiary: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED] Mariia Borysivna</p>\n<p>IBAN: [PAYMENT DETAILS OMITTED]</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Online payment via Plata by mono</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"guarantee-2\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p>12-month manufacturer's warranty.</p>\n</div>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__column-item\">\n<div class=\"product__group product__group--tabs\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<nav class=\"product-heading__nav\" id=\"nav-6af745b1449e8\">\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#description-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Description</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#reviews-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\"><div id=\"comments\">\n            A new review or comment    </div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"description-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\"><strong>The perfumed shower oil from the Rich Vibes collection</strong> cares for sensitive skin, leaving it feeling soft and beautifully scented with a long-lasting, luxurious fragrance.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Its honey-like texture gently envelops the body, delicately cleansing while preserving the skin's natural barrier.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">It is formulated with hemp oil, collagen, and panthenol.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/shower-oil-01.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Why choose the Rich Vibes Collection shower oil?</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">After showering, your skin feels tight and flaky, forcing you to immediately apply a large amount of cream immediately — this is a typical scenario for dry skin when using a regular shower gel. Shower oil solves this problem differently: you use it instead of a gel, it rinses off, but a thin protective layer remains on the skin. After towel-drying, your skin is already moisturized — no extra cream needed, or just a minimal amount.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong>The Rich Vibes Collection by Be Trendy</strong> is exactly that kind of product. Formulated with a hemp oil base, it is well-tolerated by most skin types and leaves absolutely no greasy residue after rinsing.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/shower-oil-01(1).jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"7\">Key Benefits of the Shower Oil</h2>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\">Saves time on skincare:</b> It replaces shower gel and partially acts as a moisturizer. One step instead of two.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\">Hemp oil base:</b> Not just a decorative ingredient, but a hard-working component rich in fatty acids that support the skin's barrier function. Perfect for sensitive and dryness-prone skin.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\">Perfumed formula:</b> Unlike neutral oils, this one features a long-lasting fragrance — your skin smells amazing after the shower without any extra perfume.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\">250 ml volume:</b> Lasts for about a month with daily use — a reasonable volume for testing and regular application.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\">Premium positioning:</b> The product doesn't claim to be luxury, but its ingredients and texture make it significantly superior to cheap, artificially scented gels.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"> </p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"9\">Who is the Rich Vibes Collection Perfumed Oil For?</h2>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\">If you want to simplify your skincare routine</b> — this oil is a perfect fit: it replaces both gel and lotion, saving you time.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\">If your priority is moisture <i data-index-in-node=\"29\" data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\">during</i> washing, not after</b> — this is exactly how shower oil works, unlike regular gel.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\">If you want a pleasant scent without extra perfume</b> — the fragranced formula leaves a delicate trail after your shower.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\"> </h3>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"11\">User Experience</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12,0\">After two weeks of daily use instead of regular gel, the skin on the shins and arms flakes noticeably less — even without applying lotion after the shower. Compared to a standard mass-market moisturizing gel, the difference is striking: the gel gave a clean feeling, but the skin remained dry by evening. This oil completely eliminates that issue. The only thing to keep in mind is that the bathtub can get a little slippery, which is totally normal for oils. The scent lingers on the skin for 2-3 hours after the shower, which is a great result for this type of product.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"> </h3>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Who is This Product For?</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"14\">Perfect for:</b></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"15\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,0,0\">Women with dry and normal skin who want to cut down on skincare steps.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,1,0\">Those who have tried shower oils before and understand the format.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15,2,0\">Regular use during the cold season when skin is especially prone to dryness.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\"><b data-index-in-node=\"0\" data-path-to-node=\"16\">Not recommended for:</b></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\">For oily or acne-prone body skin — an oil base can worsen the condition.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\">Those who strictly prefer a \"squeaky clean\" feeling with zero residue.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\">Those on a tight budget — the above-average price is justified by the formula, but more affordable options exist.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\"> </p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\"><strong>Summary:</strong> The Rich Vibes Collection Perfumed Shower Oil is a functional product for those looking to combine cleansing and hydration in a single step. The hemp oil base is not a marketing gimmick, but a well-founded choice for dry skin. The price is above the market average, but it fully matches the format and ingredients. If your goal is to buy a product that simplifies your routine and delivers well-nourished skin without extra steps, this shower oil gets the job done without empty promises.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\"> </p>\n<p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_NCqbEjz78s\">https://www.youtube.com/embed/_NCqbEjz78s</a></p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uid948c8c7e6cf7c7af6ad4ca2324736ebc\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uid948c8c7e6cf7c7af6ad4ca2324736ebc\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews__add-comment\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"b3b8fc0a5ff58c1966bf00cc9a65f415\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_1\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"e46ddec6173e684c11d579a016f34e88\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_2\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"3938ef223576cbc7e770a763b65d487d\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-wide\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div>\n<div id=\"uid10832feb0b6643710ae19400f7ee304e\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>"
